OL,3,GNEWSAAt least seven months of
OL,4,Arelentless rain needed to end drought,
OL,5,Aresearch shows
OL,6,
OL,7,FEven under the most likely rainfall
OL,8,Fscenario - which predicts a wetter
OL,9,Fautumn than normal based on the latest
OL,10,FMet Office forecasts - Devon and
OL,11,FCornwall and East Anglia could still be
OL,12,Fin drought by the start of spring 2027.
